### UC-3 — Envío de órdenes (POST /api/users/:userId/orders)

@base_url = http://localhost:3000

### MARKET BUY con size — 201 FILLED al precio de referencia
# User 1 (seed: cash disponible 627500). Respuesta real verificada: price null (no lleva
# límite), filledPrice = close de la última vela (PAMP 925.85), FILLED en la misma transacción.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### MARKET BUY con amountArs (monto total en pesos) — 201 FILLED
# size = floor(amountArs / precio de referencia) = floor(1000 / 925.85) = 1; el residuo queda como cash.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amountArs": 1000
}

### LIMIT GTC (default) — 201 NEW (siempre queda resting)
# Reserva limit × size de cash (10 × 900). No se llena al enviar.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 10,
  "price": 900
}

### MARKET sin fondos (user 2 del seed no tiene cash) — 201 REJECTED INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
# Respuesta real verificada. El rechazo del negocio SE PERSISTE (201), no es error HTTP.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 100
}

### LIMIT sin price — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (no crea orden)
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 10
}

### MARKET con price — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (MARKET se ejecuta a la referencia)
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10,
  "price": 900
}

### Instrumento MONEDA (ARS, id 66) — 400 INSTRUMENT_NOT_OPERABLE
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 66,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### Usuario inexistente — 404 USER_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/999/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### Instrumento inexistente — 404 INSTRUMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "NOPE",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### Sin marketdata (PGR) — 201 REJECTED NO_PRICE
# MARKET necesita el precio de referencia; PGR no tiene velas.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PGR",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### IOC que CRUZA (límite 930 >= ref 925.85) — 201 FILLED con mejora a 925.85
# BUY paga min(límite, referencia). Respuesta real verificada.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "timeInForce": "IOC",
  "size": 10,
  "price": 930
}

### IOC que NO cruza (límite 100 < ref 925.85) — 201 CANCELLED NO_IMMEDIATE_MATCH
# Evaluación única contra la referencia; sin fills parciales.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "timeInForce": "IOC",
  "size": 10,
  "price": 100
}

### Idempotencia — mismo payload, misma key (los tres con esta key idéntica salvo `size`)
# 1) Crea la orden (acá REJECTED por fondos — user 2 no tiene cash). Anotá el `id`.
# 2) MISMA key + MISMO payload → 201 con la orden ORIGINAL (mismo id, sin nuevo evento).
# 3) MISMA key + OTRO payload (size 2) → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT.
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 1,
  "price": 100
}

###
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 1,
  "price": 100
}

###
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 2,
  "price": 100
}

### Header idempotency inválido (vacío) — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key:

{
  "ticker": "PAMP",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}